    "introduction": "Imperial Brands manufactures and distributes tobacco and nicotine products across international markets. Its portfolio includes established cigarette and tobacco brands alongside newer product formats such as vapour, heated tobacco and oral nicotine. Revenue comes from repeat consumer purchases through retail and distribution channels. The business manages a mature tobacco market in which pricing, brand choice and cost control are important, while investing selectively in alternative categories. Excise taxes and restrictions on packaging, advertising and product availability strongly influence how it operates. Performance depends on managing sales volumes and product mix, maintaining distribution and adapting to changing consumer preferences within different national regulatory frameworks.",
